{"id":3,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","FireRed"],"text":"A bewitching aroma wafts from its flower. The fragrance becalms those engaged in a battle."},{"games":["Sword","LeafGreen"],"text":"Its plant blooms when it is absorbing solar energy. It stays on the move to seek sunlight."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"The flower on its back catches the sun’s rays. The sunlight is then absorbed and used for energy."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"There is a large flower on Venusaur’s back. The flower is said to take on vivid colors if it gets plenty of nutrition and sunlight. The flower’s aroma soothes the emotions of people."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"After a rainy day, the flower on its back smells stronger. The scent attracts other Pokémon."},{"games":["X","HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"By spreading the broad petals of its flower and catching the sun’s rays, it fills its body with power."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"It is able to convert sunlight into energy. As a result, it is more powerful in the summertime."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"VENUSAUR’s flower is said to take on vivid colors if it gets plenty of nutrition and sunlight. The flower’s aroma soothes the emotions of people."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"As it warms itself and absorbs the sunlight, its flower petals release a pleasant fragrance."},{"games":["Blue","Red"],"text":"The plant blooms when it is absorbing solar energy. It stays on the move to seek sunlight."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Overgrow","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Grass-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Chlorophyll","hidden":true,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Speed stat in harsh sunlight."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Grass"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"grassland","color":"Green","shape":"Quadruped","evoluti